      "type": "list_item",
      "text": "Amazomania"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This reframing of ‘adventure journalist’ Erling Söderström’s 1996 Amazonian expedition to the isolated Korubo people is an unflinching critique of the ethics of first-contact filmmaking."
    },
    {
