      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Tropical Fractals"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Leonardo Pirondi’s timely reflection on ecological collapse imagines a future in which a biodome spaceship preserves the last traces of life on Earth."
    },
